  "contentHtml": "<p>아래의 장치를 사용해 본 선생님들이 계시면, 답글 부탁드립니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>중3 아이들이 쉽게 접근하여 완성할 수 있을 정도인지 궁금합니다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>그 밖의 조언도 주시면 감사하겠습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8d1574af2ec36f7c87f68dfd3d61b249370aa2f9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8d1574af2ec36f7c87f68dfd3d61b249370aa2f9\" data-origin-width=\"1050\" data-origin-height=\"1400\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ed1c7a4466d0fd1454da66479862c85deb0b997a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ed1c7a4466d0fd1454da66479862c85deb0b997a\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/15431243287c46f90c1d41955a2661d8e9132e7e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/15431243287c46f90c1d41955a2661d8e9132e7e\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
